ersing must be the following:\n\n![](images/2b/2b6128c5a1737e3ad1fd82f91f5ccd320421ad3472ae8152440034ecea10d364.png)" 13194139533385 17592186045585 false] [17592186128868 1071 "![](images/0c/0cfd94391c0090bc628e4203af3ff15ff7407c9ecc4cc4e7a6f6ac7a1cf36b25.png)\n\nA triangular plate of mass ![](images/a7/a76c5969032432301de3fc7cda0a904f10aadae5b58e8974db1f29ee18ec14c0.png) occupies the region ![](images/3c/3c51a5e31ce9f37895e4e38935b015ba8fd40373baa1c8735bd63f3592968af9.png) in the first quadrant enclosed by the lines ![](images/29/2997a64fa661559850be321f40a59dd8b408fe6cb662615d51b53cff07ac5a89.png) and ![](images/eb/eb52b396a667b392d8cd2c0913065ec8c9014c014f9284bff1adb3eced294d0c.png) and the ![](images/4d/4d1c3fb0851b2e9ab223c4d204d3554f710a9db8f3442d5869917828d94fe837.png)-axis. The mass density at each point is proportional to its distance from the ![](images/76/76c6f393964ba1978d27eb9fd4cf2c604384750dba74b6c08e891587e2834a91.png)-axis. Find the moment of inertia of the plate about the ![](images/ea/eafdfda4fc9654c2c5aae57bb072fafa8636c8334ae4b4eed8ff5a7c6076ff4f.png)-axis." 13194139533385 17592186045585 true] [17592186128868 1071 "![](images/0c/0cfd94391c0090bc628e4203af3ff15ff7407c9ecc4cc4e7a6f6ac7a1cf36b25.png)\n\nA triangular plate of mass $M$ occupies the region $D$ in the first quadrant enclosed by the lines $y = x$ and $x = 1$, and the $x$-axis. The mass density at each point is proportional to its distance from the $x$-axis. Find the moment of inertia of the plate about the $y$-axis." 13194139533385 17592186045585 false] [17592186128868 1074 "For a plane lamina ![](images/42/42913b72caaae9f0740c30760baff88881610a1ced3ff3859222d27d1b8656b4.png) with mass density function ![](images/3e/3ee7e6579dec5241a245eab4eaf1b1fa3c180e6ec75a557baa9b2497b55558e2.png) we have the following definitions:\n\n- The moment of inertia about the ![](images/84/84b2f388da9d980669e8b0d6370edb0a12ef82752f16b4fb1b6dc6ee4c44c03d.png)-axis is given by\n![](images/60/60a59f8ad0379b033